      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEY INTERACTIONS:\n• Domain Context (KG + MCP) enriches agent reasoning with semantic knowledge and extensibility\n• Infrastructure Layer orchestrates durable execution via Temporal while routing all tools through Skills Dispatcher\n• Multi-tenancy provides isolated execution context; all queries & results scoped to tenant\n• Cross-cutting concerns (Security, Observability, Cost, HITL) apply uniformly across all layers",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 85,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KEY INTERACTIONS:\n• Domain Context (KG + MCP) enriches agent reasoning with semantic knowledge and extensibility\n• Infrastructure Layer orchestrates durable execution via Temporal while routing all tools through Skills Dispatcher\n• Multi-tenancy provides isolated execution context; all queries & results scoped to tenant\n• Cross-cutting concerns (Security, Observability, Cost, HITL) apply uniformly across all layers",
